{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1000_p", "source_sha256": "152679276c7c56d7aad7ff14720210dbde99735ed54961ea9fb9c51c0003f574", "ja": "（翼と莉緒が『和風モダン』がテーマの撮影に挑んだ。\n撮影中も、そうでない時も仲が良さそうだったな……）", "zh": "（翼和莉绪挑战了以“日式现代风”为主题的拍摄。不管是拍摄中还是其他时候，两个人看起来关系都很好啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f5761b99321894419a0218e782ccdc688ba619c560b34e25f23d2217f3b92594", "ja": "ふたりとも、撮影お疲れ様！　いい写真が\n撮れたって、監督さんもすごく褒めてたよ。", "zh": "你们两个，拍摄辛苦了！导演也夸你们，说拍出了很棒的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "76712287b9adccec6ed1a313944dea5f337f08781a867b944e27caf6ce79038c", "ja": "うふふ、よかった～。\n今日の撮影、私もすごく手応えがあったの♪", "zh": "呵呵，太好了～。\n今天的拍摄，我也感觉特别顺手呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f01a99835a55aa7cd4bbab801c488e55f6bf17a5cd0a31ba30dcd2458a8c5046", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。\n翼も、最後まで調子が良かったな。", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。翼到最后状态也一直很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "85b9541a91265ca0d3d9ab9c685993b5b9d4d1b3a84f5b86212457f089174709", "ja": "あ、わかっちゃいました？　莉緒さんのおかげで\n撮影がすっごく楽しくなっちゃって……えへへ♪", "zh": "啊，被你发现了？多亏了莉绪姐，拍摄变得特别开心……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "c5f1b6875477fd114422af0558707a794dda9de663da225e9c75c9f476f67197", "ja": "も、もう～。翼ちゃんったら♪\nでも私、特別なことをした覚えはないんだけど……。", "zh": "真是的～，小翼真是的♪\n不过，我不记得自己做过什么特别的事呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "898fc460158406473e0eb6703aed4395f5a9ccfd17036e3d4f9347f37ba745aa", "ja": "わたしのこと、いっぱい褒めてくれたじゃないですか！\nそれに、い～っぱい甘やかしてくれたし。", "zh": "你不是一直夸我嘛！\n而且还特别宠我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f6c0503f621e5b3a83a1f6004755121401067569df9a201aa07167b927ade5f7", "ja": "わたし、お仕事のやる気がどんどん出てきちゃって！\n……だーかーら！　莉緒さんのおかげ、なんですよ♪", "zh": "我就越来越有干工作的劲头了！\n……所——以——说！这都是多亏了莉绪小姐哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1008_p", "source_sha256": "12feffc1bf32957e2316628dca6371231bfdd1c14c4516a617003c395cb5320f", "ja": "なるほど。翼が珍しく仕事に集中してたのは\n莉緒が気を配ってくれてたからか。", "zh": "原来如此。翼难得这么专心工作，是因为莉绪一直在关照她啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "3de802d6b90143872c0193a34df69694f8887d80f7cca3bbf6f4ca81469eaf0d", "ja": "そんな……私はいつも通りしてただけよ。それに……\n私こそ翼ちゃんからやる気をもらったし、おあいこよ♪", "zh": "没什么……我只是和平时一样做而已。而且……\n反倒是我从翼那里获得了干劲，所以彼此彼此啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "05eb74c3061e4606c12a396493bccfe12003296a6b8c0878507c5745ccbe1c49", "ja": "……わたしが？\n莉緒さんに甘えてただけですよ？", "zh": "……我吗？\n我只是向莉绪姐撒娇而已吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "f70c8b542a078e432fae7044881de3390bbdb788debcb15ea7ee9bd53b2f87fd", "ja": "そうね。でも翼ちゃんの可愛いとこを見てると、\n私も対抗心が燃えてきちゃって……。", "zh": "是啊。不过看着小翼可爱的样子，我也忍不住燃起了竞争心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "45cfed5101f0f3b64257a32d09cd294667eea3a99535afaec3d412ede55bbee4", "ja": "気がついたら、私もイイ表情が撮れてたの。\nだから、翼ちゃんのおかげってわけ♪", "zh": "回过神来，才发现我也拍到了很棒的表情。\n所以说，这都多亏了翼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1013_p", "source_sha256": "74f2f3db22907da3dce731b83cbacd3f37fe0348043692e036a6a037991762c3", "ja": "はは、そうか。無意識とはいえ、\nお互いにいい影響を与え合っていたんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。虽然是无意识的，但我们也在互相影响，让彼此变得更好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f371203c39c4b2888f0bbe779769431b1c83f561ee71380e082c5dd57da8525d", "ja": "そっかぁ……。\nじゃあ、わたしと莉緒さんって相性バッチリですね♪", "zh": "这样啊……  \n那我和莉绪姐还真是合拍呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b60468ba89ea84a7218f71a0fd7871034cb73564084047e75409a3abf733d5de", "ja": "ああ。撮影中もそうだったけど、休憩中も\n息がピッタリで、本当の姉妹みたいに見えたよ。", "zh": "嗯。拍摄时就是这样，休息时也配合得天衣无缝，看起来就像真正的姐妹一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "fe4727c5c2fe6222d877cba6a0cc141d1d9806d2be50ed8355151b647fcab692", "ja": "姉妹だなんて……うふふ。\nこんなに可愛らしい妹ができて、嬉しいわ♪", "zh": "姐妹什么的……呵呵。\n能有这么可爱的妹妹，我好开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e8adcf90c28f47ea6b003f4d9aeb292484fb3f3d56419fa8f3e25d4cad16351b", "ja": "わたしもです、莉緒さん……\nじゃなくて、莉緒お姉ちゃん♪", "zh": "我也是，莉绪小姐……\n不对，是莉绪姐姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "ac908df2515c949943f56790a401adee23e6211571c7dbd06b9563dc2c9d5310", "ja": "ん～、キュンってきちゃった♪　こうなったら、\n私達ふたりで姉妹ユニットを結成するしかないわね！", "zh": "嗯～，心都怦怦跳起来了♪ 既然这样，\n我们俩只能组成姐妹组合了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3470811adcdc26cbd53c737d93fc3fb697432ecd32b21a96a0d3e3c52ba06982", "ja": "わあ～、ナイスアイディアですね！\nきっと今日みたいに、楽しく過ごせそう♪", "zh": "哇～真是个好主意呢！\n一定能像今天这样，开开心心地度过每一天♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1020_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0474_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7c6cb34f327817606010674b2e8b0afb15f6d8577b4000d27bc2919699f75372", "ja": "わたしも莉緒お姉ちゃんと一緒にお仕事したいな～。\n期待してますね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我也想和莉绪姐姐一起工作呀～。\n我很期待哦，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
